{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Party Card Game Where You Scramble to Find the Perfect Answer to Deranged Questions.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Banana of Doom, a  fast-paced, word-combo card game where everything is absurd and everyone is hungry for the top spot. Build ridiculous phrases, de-throne your friends, and claw your way to be the top banana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/967390b512f50169ba4cbf15e438a940.avif?t=1773439008\" alt=\"100+ contests\" width=1478 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/8682c445f4863018be95463d687ccc81.poster.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/8682c445f4863018be95463d687ccc81.webm?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/8682c445f4863018be95463d687ccc81.mp4?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each round kicks off with players picking a scenario from our curated set. Your goal is to come up with the funniest answer possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/352c994cd693c1cfbee567d14ef1f2f2.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1478 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/58858bfee368169a2ed3bf6154a6a1e0.poster.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/58858bfee368169a2ed3bf6154a6a1e0.webm?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/58858bfee368169a2ed3bf6154a6a1e0.mp4?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to a challenge contest using at least two cards in your hand or draw more cards from the deck. The better your combo, the greater your chances to take the top spot.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ Playing Words Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6+ Thematic Booster packs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/91f7560da7eb2db521c0c36b893f45a3.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1478 height=146 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/11dd75390a3997a2259f50d5035f9984.poster.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/11dd75390a3997a2259f50d5035f9984.webm?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/11dd75390a3997a2259f50d5035f9984.mp4?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round come up with the funniest, silliest, or downright weirdest answer to win. Cards are judged head to head by player votes or by Mighty Banana God depending on the game mode of your choice. Earn points for winning rounds, busting streaks, and crushing your friends\u2019 momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/e612ff2b6b5637e6aef576fb294f7515.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1478 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/3631892de52e232fbb31030c7019b179.poster.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/3631892de52e232fbb31030c7019b179.webm?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/3631892de52e232fbb31030c7019b179.mp4?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No limits to your imagination, scroll through curated word variations to help you craft the perfect answer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/2b773829b61e65fd26dbecd96e30de6c.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1478 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/f24cd0d43c53c1981ccabd8e726bb67b.poster.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/f24cd0d43c53c1981ccabd8e726bb67b.webm?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/f24cd0d43c53c1981ccabd8e726bb67b.mp4?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip open booster packs and discover new cards inside.\u00a0Each pack includes fresh thematic words, rare art and unique  designs crafted by our art team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/7fc9bbc658c8e1da7c6dc3655eb5380e.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1478 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/cfd75f93fda6db613b581b7af50ca7dd.poster.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1170 height=1682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/cfd75f93fda6db613b581b7af50ca7dd.webm?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/cfd75f93fda6db613b581b7af50ca7dd.mp4?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card collectors, assemble! Begin with the Base Set, crack open booster packs for new words and fresh art, and chase rare cards that flex your style. Customize your deck and outplay everyone with flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/2296089be930c950f22ca52133de5ada.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1478 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/8670d9d3d20e17628b848053ea2edb34.avif?t=1773439008\" width=608 height=445 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Banana of Doom community! Get sneak peeks at upcoming features and jump into games with the devs. We promise we don\u2019t bite</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/