xtras/3631892de52e232fbb31030c7019b179.mp4?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No limits to your imagination, scroll through curated word variations to help you craft the perfect answer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/2b773829b61e65fd26dbecd96e30de6c.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1478 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/f24cd0d43c53c1981ccabd8e726bb67b.poster.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/f24cd0d43c53c1981ccabd8e726bb67b.webm?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/f24cd0d43c53c1981ccabd8e726bb67b.mp4?t=1773439008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip open booster packs and discover new cards inside.\u00a0Each pack includes fresh thematic words, rare art and unique  designs crafted by our art team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/7fc9bbc658c8e1da7c6dc3655eb5380e.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1478 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/cfd75f93fda6db613b581b7af50ca7dd.poster.avif?t=1773439008\" width=1170 height=1682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898830/extras/cfd75f93fda6db613b581b7af50ca7dd.webm?t=1773439